Seemless WP7.5: native macOS arm64 build of vkd3d-proton (osy neptune a8b7cd4).

Based on spike S8's port (spikes/S8-d3d12-moltenvk/vkd3d-proton-macos.patch),
without its S8_SOFT_CAPS switch, rebased onto the neptune fork:
- meson: treat darwin like linux (libdl, pkg-config, installed headers).
- sonames: no Vulkan loader; load @loader_path/libMoltenVK.dylib directly
  (VKD3D_VULKAN_LIBRARY overrides) and d3d12core from @loader_path. Fixes
  upstream's d3d12core soname missing the "lib" prefix.
- vkGetPhysicalDeviceCooperativeMatrixPropertiesKHR optional (no loader
  trampoline when MoltenVK is used directly; only called when supported).
- platform/threads/file/cache: getprogname, pthread_*_np, renamex_np,
  ftello/fseeko.
- VK_KHR_portability_enumeration / _subset enabled (MoltenVK is a
  portability driver).
- cs_emit_nv_memory_decompression_regions: no atomic on a vector element
  (MoltenVK's SPIRV-Cross emits MSL Metal rejects; built at device creation).
Licence: LGPL-2.1 (vkd3d-proton).

